A function that wraps a DELEGATECALL to a view function, cannot be view

function seeSomething() ... {
    x.delegatecall(SOME_VIEW_FUNCTION)
}

---

DELEGATECALL with msg.value >0 into a non-payable function causes a mysterious error - difficult to debug

I can't trust solc to output good bytecode

having to cast contracts to address() even though all contracts are address, like address deployed = address(new Contract())

